WEBVTT

00:00:01.987 --> 00:00:05.855
The beginning breeze

00:00:06.258 --> 00:00:10.126
Delivers this message

00:00:10.562 --> 00:00:19.129
"Because I have always believed in you"

00:00:20.272 --> 00:00:20.739
The Story of Saiunkoku

00:00:20.739 --> 00:00:28.847
The Story of Saiunkoku
We are standing in the land
we dreamed of back then

00:00:28.847 --> 00:00:29.142
The Story of Saiunkoku

00:00:29.381 --> 00:00:36.651
We feel weak at the knees a little,
gazing over the scenery

00:00:36.888 --> 00:00:41.018
But please don't look back

00:00:41.159 --> 00:00:45.186
Because you've decided to go forward

00:00:45.397 --> 00:00:49.493
I looked up into the sky to see
the rainbow with seven colors

00:00:49.768 --> 00:00:53.204
Can you see it too?

00:00:53.471 --> 00:00:57.373
The beginning breeze

00:00:57.776 --> 00:01:01.371
Delivers this message

00:01:01.813 --> 00:01:10.050
I will watch over you as
you go forth to chase your dreams

00:01:10.422 --> 00:01:18.625
The dancing winds in the blazing sun

00:01:19.064 --> 00:01:28.735
Fly forth strongly
with the wings of freedom

00:01:32.877 --> 00:01:35.402
The man controlling the Murderous
Blades from behind the scenes...

00:01:36.114 --> 00:01:37.979
...Sakujun Sa, has disappeared.

00:01:38.049 --> 00:01:41.485
Shortly after, Shurei encountered
Kinka's Mayor, Shin Sai.

00:01:41.820 --> 00:01:43.788
However, immediately thereafter...!

00:01:54.165 --> 00:01:55.655
Sakujun Sa!

00:01:59.337 --> 00:02:01.305
I cannot forgive that man.

00:02:02.841 --> 00:02:07.801
The Prettier the Flower,
the Higher the Branch

00:02:09.614 --> 00:02:11.809
So Sojun has died.

00:02:12.417 --> 00:02:13.748
You may go.

00:02:18.657 --> 00:02:21.854
Sakujun. To think he has
started to make his move.

00:02:22.394 --> 00:02:26.194
I thought he was nothing more than a
hedonist. I mustn't underestimate him.

00:02:34.539 --> 00:02:36.063
Is that you, Chusho?

00:02:36.675 --> 00:02:38.370
E-Elder Brother.

00:02:39.511 --> 00:02:41.536
Why the eldest legitimate
son of the main house?

00:02:41.613 --> 00:02:43.877
I thought the two of you
got along well.

00:02:47.218 --> 00:02:49.686
Every last heir of
the main house has died.

00:02:50.588 --> 00:02:53.386
As of now, I will be
the head of the Sa Clan.

00:02:56.261 --> 00:02:59.492
Sakujun may well be like
my elder brother.

00:03:00.198 --> 00:03:02.166
The brother who never let anyone
see his other side...

00:03:02.233 --> 00:03:04.167
...and when the opportunity...

00:03:04.235 --> 00:03:08.604
...came along, created a bloodbath,
killing all the men of the main house.

00:03:18.016 --> 00:03:19.745
I'll be waiting in Koren.

00:03:32.897 --> 00:03:34.023
My Lady.

00:03:57.455 --> 00:03:58.854
Such beautiful weather.

00:04:06.431 --> 00:04:07.625
Lady Shurei?

00:04:08.933 --> 00:04:11.401
Oh, the tea's ready? Thank you.

00:04:13.071 --> 00:04:15.699
Korin, I'm glad you were safe.

00:04:15.840 --> 00:04:17.774
That's my line!

00:04:18.042 --> 00:04:21.170
You slept for so long,
I was so worried the whole time...

00:04:21.246 --> 00:04:23.146
...I couldn't even sleep at night!

00:04:23.214 --> 00:04:26.547
I was only sleeping from
exhaustion, right, Eigetsu?

00:04:26.785 --> 00:04:30.152
That's right. You never had the chance
to rest during your long voyage...

00:04:30.221 --> 00:04:32.246
...so this was just the result of it.

00:04:34.759 --> 00:04:36.454
Get out already!

00:04:36.528 --> 00:04:39.554
I can take care of things
here on my own, quack doctor!

00:04:40.064 --> 00:04:41.554
Uh, um...!

00:04:45.170 --> 00:04:48.037
Then, please take
this medicine with your tea.

00:04:48.173 --> 00:04:49.265
Thank you.

00:04:52.010 --> 00:04:54.604
What's wrong?
You're being very cold, aren't you?

00:04:54.679 --> 00:04:57.045
But, Lady Shurei!
He was really mean!

00:04:57.248 --> 00:04:59.716
He collapsed after Ryuren
made him drink some wine...

00:04:59.784 --> 00:05:02.252
...so I was trying to
take care of him, when...!

00:05:02.487 --> 00:05:04.682
You're in my way.
Outta my way, stupid girl.

00:05:04.789 --> 00:05:08.384
- Saying that, he pushed me away!
- Well, um, that's because...!

00:05:08.460 --> 00:05:10.428
I'm not fond of such people.

00:05:15.600 --> 00:05:18.160
Lady Shurei! This is no
laughing matter!

00:05:18.236 --> 00:05:21.694
But I haven't seen you so lively
in quite some time, Korin.

00:05:23.274 --> 00:05:25.401
We have Eigetsu to thank for it.

00:05:26.945 --> 00:05:29.106
Hey, Korin, please smile.

00:05:29.914 --> 00:05:33.645
- I like seeing you smile.
- Lady Shurei

00:05:34.018 --> 00:05:37.044
Thank you for all your work
in being my replacement.

00:05:38.122 --> 00:05:40.090
You were in the greatest danger.

00:05:46.297 --> 00:05:48.094
Princess, do you have a moment?

00:05:48.166 --> 00:05:50.464
There's someone here
who would like to see you.

00:05:50.735 --> 00:05:51.963
See me?

00:05:53.805 --> 00:05:55.067
What is it?

00:05:55.840 --> 00:05:58.832
Oh, nothing, I'm just glad
to see you're feeling better.

00:05:59.711 --> 00:06:02.942
I'm sorry I worried you.
I'm fine now.

00:06:03.047 --> 00:06:05.481
Okay. Come in, Koku.

00:06:06.150 --> 00:06:07.344
Koku?

00:06:09.754 --> 00:06:12.848
I'm pleased to meet you,
I'm Kokujun Sa.

00:06:13.224 --> 00:06:14.555
Kokujun.

00:06:16.060 --> 00:06:17.652
That man's younger brother.

00:06:18.663 --> 00:06:20.790
But they don't look at all alike.

00:06:20.932 --> 00:06:22.092
Princess?

00:06:23.401 --> 00:06:24.493
I'm sorry.

00:06:24.969 --> 00:06:27.437
Well you see,
even though you're brothers...

00:06:27.739 --> 00:06:29.866
...you come across as very
different people.

00:06:30.108 --> 00:06:33.976
That's true, I guess. The eldest,
Sojun, was very hot-tempered...

00:06:34.746 --> 00:06:36.907
...and in contrast,
the second son, Sakujun...

00:06:36.981 --> 00:06:39.950
...is so beautiful you wouldn't
think we were related.

00:06:40.418 --> 00:06:44.514
And as you can see, I, the third son,
am nothing more than a commoner.

00:06:44.622 --> 00:06:48.114
No, I disagree.
If it weren't for you...

00:06:48.459 --> 00:06:51.951
...I would probably not have been able
to see Eigetsu and Korin alive again.

00:06:52.997 --> 00:06:56.694
Thank you for protecting the
people who mean so much to me.

00:06:59.671 --> 00:07:00.638
Um...

00:07:00.905 --> 00:07:03.601
I have a favor I'd like to ask.

00:07:03.675 --> 00:07:04.642
What is it?

00:07:04.709 --> 00:07:07.109
Would it be all right if I were to...

00:07:07.478 --> 00:07:10.470
...see to the burial of my older
brother Sojun's remains, alone?

00:07:18.523 --> 00:07:21.458
It's been a while since your last
return home, hasn't it, Enjun?

00:07:24.062 --> 00:07:26.257
The Chrysanthemum Residence.

00:07:26.965 --> 00:07:29.763
The chrysanthemum emblem
out front has been scratched out...

00:07:29.834 --> 00:07:30.801
...and the Sa Clan crest...

00:07:30.868 --> 00:07:33.302
...the Profusion of Peacocks,
has been carved in its place.

00:07:33.972 --> 00:07:35.303
Sakujun.

00:07:37.141 --> 00:07:41.009
To think that someone would
erase the chrysanthemum...

00:07:41.179 --> 00:07:44.012
...the flower bestowed upon you
by the previous king.

00:07:45.183 --> 00:07:47.651
That monster,
who at the mere age of fifteen...

00:07:47.719 --> 00:07:50.517
...manipulated the Murderous Blades
as he pleased...

00:07:50.588 --> 00:07:51.953
...is finally making his move.

00:07:55.193 --> 00:07:59.459
Let's see. Where should I be
taking this? To the new governors?

00:08:00.098 --> 00:08:01.963
To Yushun Tei?

00:08:02.767 --> 00:08:04.826
Or to Eiki's place?

00:08:14.912 --> 00:08:17.506
I'm glad that you're feeling better.

00:08:18.182 --> 00:08:19.547
Why, you're...!

00:08:19.617 --> 00:08:21.175
Allow me to introduce myself.

00:08:21.252 --> 00:08:25.154
I'm Sai Sho, the head of the Merchants
Guild's Special District of Kinka.

00:08:25.590 --> 00:08:28.525
Sai... Then you must be
the son of the Mayor of Kinka!

00:08:28.726 --> 00:08:31.388
And also the leader of the Special
District of Kinka at such a young age?

00:08:31.763 --> 00:08:36.029
I'm not as young as you two, so it
hurts a bit to see you so surprised.

00:08:36.367 --> 00:08:41.031
I'm sorry. I had assumed that the other
man was the special district leader.

00:08:43.007 --> 00:08:45.771
He really is the special district leader.

00:08:46.277 --> 00:08:50.077
Not only that, his older twin sister
is the provincial branch leader.

00:08:50.615 --> 00:08:51.582
In other words...

00:08:51.649 --> 00:08:54.812
...together these two siblings
control commerce in Sa Province.

00:08:55.019 --> 00:08:58.580
I hear that the Merchants Guild places
great importance on practicality.

00:08:59.390 --> 00:09:01.358
Becoming district leader
at such a young age...

00:09:01.426 --> 00:09:03.360
...means he must be
extremely capable.

00:09:03.428 --> 00:09:05.919
Governor Hong, I shall
fulfill my promise to you.

00:09:06.330 --> 00:09:08.890
You have my word that the Merchants
Guild of Kinka will commit...

00:09:09.634 --> 00:09:12.262
...eighty percent of its strength
to assist the new governors.

00:09:12.804 --> 00:09:15.705
E-Eighty percent?
That's a merchant for you.

00:09:15.773 --> 00:09:19.368
It is our practice to always keep
resources in reserve...

00:09:19.610 --> 00:09:21.407
...for emergency situations.

00:09:21.679 --> 00:09:23.977
I don't dislike that way of thinking.

00:09:24.048 --> 00:09:26.608
After all, Princess certainly
knows how to cut costs.

00:09:26.918 --> 00:09:29.978
Well, I'm sure we'll get along
just fine, Governor Hong.

00:09:30.688 --> 00:09:32.781
I'll get in touch
with my elder sister.

00:09:33.191 --> 00:09:35.284
We will also arrange for
an ample loan.

00:09:35.593 --> 00:09:38.221
Of course, we'll be
claiming due compensation.

00:09:39.497 --> 00:09:42.057
Is it something that we'll
be able to pay back?

00:09:42.333 --> 00:09:43.630
Our price is that you agree
to bring order...

00:09:43.701 --> 00:09:46.534
...and govern in such a way that we...

00:09:46.604 --> 00:09:48.902
...the Merchants Guild, will be
more able to carry out business...

00:09:48.973 --> 00:09:50.270
...here in Sa Province...

00:09:50.875 --> 00:09:54.811
...where the Sa Clan's tyranny
has become so entrenched.

00:09:55.279 --> 00:09:56.644
How does that sound?

00:09:59.050 --> 00:10:01.985
You're most generous to
accept payment afterwards.

00:10:03.354 --> 00:10:05.982
But we won't be giving you
any breaks when we collect.

00:10:06.491 --> 00:10:08.118
I could discuss this
with Eigetsu...

00:10:08.192 --> 00:10:10.387
...but I'm sure he'd have
the same thoughts as I do.

00:10:10.461 --> 00:10:12.053
Ensei, it appears that
we're going to be...

00:10:12.130 --> 00:10:14.496
...in serious debt before
even taking office.

00:10:14.565 --> 00:10:15.657
Will you help?

00:10:15.733 --> 00:10:20.136
With Sho on your case, you're gonna
have to work extra hard to pay it off.

00:10:20.605 --> 00:10:21.936
I look forward to it!

00:10:22.373 --> 00:10:24.000
Then we have a deal.

00:10:24.075 --> 00:10:28.011
Okay, let's work out the details
before departing for Koren.

00:10:28.679 --> 00:10:31.045
Governor To is currently
working with my father...

00:10:31.115 --> 00:10:34.778
...to get the disturbance under control,
so we'll begin with you.

00:10:35.119 --> 00:10:36.086
Yes.

00:11:45.089 --> 00:11:50.049
The Story of Saiunkoku

00:11:51.863 --> 00:11:53.660
Would you hurry up
and go home?!

00:11:54.298 --> 00:11:56.163
Please, go home, will you?

00:11:58.502 --> 00:12:01.062
Thank you for bringing
the seal and charm.

00:12:01.472 --> 00:12:03.337
You can return to your journey.

00:12:03.407 --> 00:12:04.567
Ryuren.

00:12:04.642 --> 00:12:07.236
Please come visit again once
things have settled down somewhat.

00:12:07.812 --> 00:12:10.474
But kindred spirit
number one, number two.

00:12:10.882 --> 00:12:16.377
Please! Go! We don't want to
drag you into this any further.

00:12:39.410 --> 00:12:42.140
I was staying here so I could get
dragged into things further...!

00:12:44.248 --> 00:12:48.344
Only two people exist in this world,
kindred spirit number one and two...

00:12:49.153 --> 00:12:51.747
...who can take advantage
of Ryuren Ran.

00:13:03.734 --> 00:13:05.861
It was the right thing to do, right?

00:13:07.238 --> 00:13:08.398
Come in.

00:13:09.473 --> 00:13:10.462
Excuse me.

00:13:12.410 --> 00:13:13.968
I brought you some tea.

00:13:14.045 --> 00:13:15.171
Thank you.

00:13:18.115 --> 00:13:21.243
Say, Korin... Would you mind
if I asked you something?

00:13:21.319 --> 00:13:22.286
Yes?

00:13:22.954 --> 00:13:25.320
I ask this question in
the most innocent sense.

00:13:25.890 --> 00:13:29.189
What was Advisor Sa to you?

00:13:37.635 --> 00:13:38.761
What's that?

00:13:39.003 --> 00:13:40.561
A reminder of him.

00:13:42.106 --> 00:13:44.097
He was everything to me.

00:13:45.042 --> 00:13:50.105
If it were for his sake, I would have no
regrets even throwing away my own life.

00:13:51.515 --> 00:13:52.982
Is that... love?

00:13:55.319 --> 00:13:57.787
I don't know. Just...

00:13:59.657 --> 00:14:01.818
I wanted to exist for his sake.

00:14:03.627 --> 00:14:06.892
I had no hesitation
dirtying my hands in sin.

00:14:08.599 --> 00:14:13.161
So, most likely, the word love would not
be suitable to describe the feeling.

00:14:15.706 --> 00:14:20.837
I believed that I was the one who
cared most about Enjun in this world.

00:14:21.812 --> 00:14:23.541
But I was wrong.

00:14:23.614 --> 00:14:26.105
I can't even begin
to compare to his wife.

00:14:26.717 --> 00:14:29.709
Advisor Sa's wife?
You mean Lady Eiki?

00:14:29.787 --> 00:14:33.587
Yes. My feelings were so tiny
in comparison.

00:14:34.492 --> 00:14:39.555
When she accepted me
in Sa Province, Lady Eiki said this...

00:14:40.498 --> 00:14:45.936
Choosing Enjun at such a young age,
you have great judgment in character.

00:14:46.270 --> 00:14:49.967
The man I chose is the
best man in this country...

00:14:50.041 --> 00:14:52.532
...so I'm all too aware of how you feel.

00:14:53.310 --> 00:14:55.141
However, it must have been
hard on you.

00:14:55.212 --> 00:15:00.377
While he may be the best man,
he is the worst lover to a woman.

00:15:02.253 --> 00:15:05.552
Those were Lady Eiki's
first words to me.

00:15:06.557 --> 00:15:08.718
She's an extremely
strong person, isn't she?

00:15:08.793 --> 00:15:12.786
Yes. At that point, I realized
deep down in my heart...

00:15:12.863 --> 00:15:15.889
...that she was the most
important person to Enjun.

00:15:16.267 --> 00:15:17.928
Even though they lived far apart...

00:15:18.002 --> 00:15:20.562
...their commitment to each
other never wavered.

00:15:22.239 --> 00:15:25.606
They felt for one another even
though they were apart. I see.

00:15:26.010 --> 00:15:28.478
There are many different
forms of love, aren't there?

00:15:48.632 --> 00:15:51.294
So I take it this is your true self?

00:15:52.703 --> 00:15:54.671
What do you want, Sakujun?

00:15:55.039 --> 00:15:58.008
You've been locked up
in this place for over half a year.

00:15:58.375 --> 00:16:02.004
How could you not be bored,
Yushun Tei?

00:16:02.446 --> 00:16:05.381
If it were possible,
I'd love to be bored.

00:16:06.083 --> 00:16:08.415
Unfortunately, there are simply
too many things to be done.

00:16:09.019 --> 00:16:11.544
If you have no business here,
then I ask that you please leave.

00:16:11.622 --> 00:16:12.816
You're no fun.

00:16:13.224 --> 00:16:14.953
I'm busy.

00:16:18.963 --> 00:16:20.863
Sakujun, what is that?

00:16:21.332 --> 00:16:23.027
What do you think it is?

00:16:24.101 --> 00:16:26.729
Hey, Yushun. Isn't it strange?

00:16:28.305 --> 00:16:31.468
Even a hair decoration can take
on exceptional meaning if it...

00:16:32.343 --> 00:16:37.303
...had been used by someone special.
I've never thought this way before.

00:16:38.916 --> 00:16:40.781
Love, is it?

00:16:41.185 --> 00:16:43.153
Yes, my first infatuation.

00:16:44.488 --> 00:16:50.085
Spring has come at a late age for me,
in my twenty-ninth year.

00:16:51.162 --> 00:16:53.630
I don't care to have you
warding off boredom...

00:16:53.697 --> 00:16:55.688
...by making advances
on my dear superior.

00:16:56.066 --> 00:16:58.591
I suggest you think things
over quickly...

00:16:58.669 --> 00:17:00.830
...and return the flower
you have in your hand.

00:17:01.305 --> 00:17:03.068
I truly believe I was most fortunate...

00:17:03.140 --> 00:17:06.541
...to meet that noblewoman
and her music.

00:17:08.279 --> 00:17:10.679
I could very well
never again be able to find...

00:17:10.748 --> 00:17:12.613
...a person who captures my
attention so thoroughly.

00:17:12.683 --> 00:17:15.743
So if I were to grow weary
of that music...

00:17:16.687 --> 00:17:20.521
...I feel that I would lose
all reason to live.

00:17:21.825 --> 00:17:25.317
They say that the prettier the flower,
the higher the branch...

00:17:25.696 --> 00:17:27.323
...but I will get that flower.

00:17:27.965 --> 00:17:30.433
I will have that girl,
no matter what it takes.

00:17:31.402 --> 00:17:34.803
Grandfather wants to make use of your
provisional governor's authority...

00:17:35.806 --> 00:17:38.969
...and promptly have Koren
completely sealed off.

00:17:40.211 --> 00:17:42.406
Would you be kind
enough to tell me why?

00:17:42.479 --> 00:17:45.448
The new governors have
yet to enter Koren.

00:17:45.950 --> 00:17:47.281
That's why, right?

00:17:47.518 --> 00:17:48.712
And if I refuse?

00:17:49.186 --> 00:17:51.780
I'm guessing a number of things
could end up happening in Koren.

00:17:54.225 --> 00:17:55.988
It's all right, Yushun Tei.

00:17:56.493 --> 00:17:59.394
Your superiors should still
be able to enter the capital...

00:17:59.463 --> 00:18:01.363
...even after it's been sealed off.

00:18:01.432 --> 00:18:02.626
Isn't that right?

00:18:03.067 --> 00:18:04.125
Later.

00:18:06.971 --> 00:18:09.769
Everything that needs to be done
has already been done.

00:18:10.841 --> 00:18:15.972
There isn't a single thing for us
to doubt at this stage, Sakujun.

00:18:23.554 --> 00:18:27.888
For the oldest son, Sojun, to rest
in a place like this all on his own...

00:18:30.194 --> 00:18:34.130
While I was afraid of you,
I certainly did not dislike you.

00:18:35.399 --> 00:18:37.526
The Sa Clan as it stands
right now is wrong.

00:18:38.068 --> 00:18:40.002
As a member of the Sa Clan...

00:18:40.070 --> 00:18:43.665
...I intend to do as much
as I can to set things right.

00:18:44.208 --> 00:18:46.267
I must stop brother Sakujun.

00:18:48.412 --> 00:18:50.846
The second son of the Sa Clan
did that to Shurei?

00:18:51.015 --> 00:18:53.813
Reishin sent a personal letter
to confirm matters.

00:18:54.218 --> 00:18:57.119
So there's no mistake about it.

00:18:57.721 --> 00:19:02.317
Sakujun Sa. He's Advisor Sa's younger
brother Chusho's grandson, isn't he?

00:19:03.294 --> 00:19:07.094
Rumor has it that he's
a completely hedonistic playboy.

00:19:07.498 --> 00:19:08.931
Impressive, Ran Clan.

00:19:08.999 --> 00:19:12.867
You're well informed when it comes to
information on the seven color clans.

00:19:13.137 --> 00:19:18.040
And? Is that man still alive even
after Reishin has taken action?

00:19:18.475 --> 00:19:19.464
Yeah.

00:19:19.543 --> 00:19:22.535
Wow. That's one
stubborn man, I see.

00:19:23.013 --> 00:19:25.914
That tells us that
he's not merely a hedonist.

00:19:25.983 --> 00:19:27.575
We can't underestimate this guy.

00:19:27.651 --> 00:19:30.381
There may be some disturbances
again, much like there were...

00:19:30.454 --> 00:19:32.547
...when Advisor Sa took over
the main house of Sa.

00:19:44.601 --> 00:19:45.727
All right.

00:19:46.103 --> 00:19:49.834
We need to head to Koren
as soon as this work is finished.

00:19:59.717 --> 00:20:01.082
It's Gan Lu tea.

00:20:01.285 --> 00:20:04.584
I promised to make you lots of it
back at the inn in Sakyo, right?

00:20:05.889 --> 00:20:06.878
My Lady.

00:20:06.957 --> 00:20:07.981
What is it?

00:20:08.158 --> 00:20:10.718
Am I special to you?

00:20:12.529 --> 00:20:13.996
What about that man.

00:20:15.032 --> 00:20:19.162
That man who said that he loves you.
What is he to you?

00:20:25.275 --> 00:20:28.005
That person... was similar to Ryuki.

00:20:28.078 --> 00:20:29.670
They aren't at all alike!

00:20:29.747 --> 00:20:31.806
No, they're very similar.

00:20:33.083 --> 00:20:35.017
They're both childlike adults.

00:20:36.720 --> 00:20:39.450
Yet they're complete opposites.
That's why...!

00:20:41.125 --> 00:20:42.285
That's why...?

00:20:42.926 --> 00:20:45.952
He leaves a long-lasting impression.

00:20:46.296 --> 00:20:49.959
You haven't once mentioned
his real name, have you?

00:20:50.501 --> 00:20:54.597
Do you not want to acknowledge it?
That he is a member of the Sa Clan?

00:20:55.406 --> 00:20:57.033
It's not like that.

00:20:57.107 --> 00:20:59.632
It's very rare for you to lie
to even me.

00:21:00.043 --> 00:21:01.101
Seiran.

00:21:01.178 --> 00:21:02.873
That man is too dangerous.

00:21:03.647 --> 00:21:05.842
That man is eternal darkness.

00:21:06.216 --> 00:21:09.811
Please don't get dragged in.
And don't be deceived.

00:21:10.888 --> 00:21:13.448
Saying that he loves
you more than anyone...

00:21:13.524 --> 00:21:15.116
Those words are a lie!

00:21:17.728 --> 00:21:19.719
You haven't tied your hair.

00:21:20.798 --> 00:21:22.925
Did that man say something to you?

00:21:24.001 --> 00:21:26.401
You look much nicer
with your hair down.

00:21:28.305 --> 00:21:30.330
One day, you will fall in love.

00:21:35.279 --> 00:21:38.146
I've been aware of that
for a long time now.

00:21:42.286 --> 00:21:44.186
Seiran.

00:21:44.254 --> 00:21:48.691
But if he is your partner, know that
I would be a much better choice.

00:21:50.694 --> 00:21:55.529
I want you to be happy. I remain by
your side for that purpose alone.

00:22:05.876 --> 00:22:08.572
So, I will not forgive that man.

00:22:37.808 --> 00:22:40.470
You dare pick a fight with me?

00:22:41.478 --> 00:22:45.175
I commend you for the courage to do
so knowing that I am Prince Seien.

00:22:46.450 --> 00:22:47.917
Sakujun Sa!

00:23:20.684 --> 00:23:21.776
Come.

00:23:21.852 --> 00:23:23.615
To the provincial capital, Koren.

00:23:23.754 --> 00:23:25.119
I'll be waiting.

00:23:30.661 --> 00:23:35.758
You've always led a very carefree life
and right now

00:23:35.899 --> 00:23:42.463
Amidst this rain
what sort of dreams are you chasing?

00:23:42.573 --> 00:23:47.636
And while you are fighting
loneliness somewhere

00:23:47.744 --> 00:23:52.738
You must be holding back
the tears too

00:23:53.817 --> 00:23:58.277
You say you'll be fine alone

00:23:59.823 --> 00:24:04.954
You are just like me

00:24:05.696 --> 00:24:10.224
Even if we have to take
the longer way around

00:24:10.300 --> 00:24:16.205
We somehow still prefer this route

00:24:17.174 --> 00:24:22.976
Whenever I feel happy or glad

00:24:23.080 --> 00:24:27.949
I will always think of you

00:24:29.086 --> 00:24:41.760
I believe that the colorful seasons will
deliver this feeling of mine to you

00:24:45.135 --> 00:24:45.669
Next Episode

00:24:45.669 --> 00:24:47.604
Next Episode
We need to hurry to Koren.

00:24:47.604 --> 00:24:47.638
Next Episode

00:24:47.638 --> 00:24:47.904
Next Episode
